{"title":"Gottfried Leibniz","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Gottfried Leibniz</b> (July 1 1646 – November 14, 1716) was a German mathematician, scholar, and philosopher. He is most famous for discovering <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calculus\" title=\"Calculus\">calculus</a> \nindependently from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Isaac_Newton\" title=\"Isaac Newton\">Isaac Newton</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gottfried_Leibniz&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calculus\" title=\"Calculus\">Calculus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Isaac_Newton\" title=\"Isaac Newton\">Isaac Newton</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Gottfried_Leibniz&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018085811\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 292/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.290      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.290      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7062:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018085811 and revision id 251989. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n --